-- Sibling probe to maxEnumerateBoth.ppl: here one operand (0.5) is
-- Deterministic and the other is a single enumerable random Bool-shaped
-- float. Exercises IRCompiler's isForwardOnly single-operand enumeration
-- case (the one-side-deterministic sibling of the both-enumerable path),
-- again with no max-specific IRCompiler code.
main = max (if Uniform < 0.5 then 1.0 else 0.0) 0.5
